he correct equation to determine $x$ is the following:\n\n$$\nx={70}^{∘}-{30}^{∘}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-3fbfac83-f221-5199-afc1-0a4537739b09"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-3fbfac83-f221-5199-afc1-0a4537739b09" :answer-field/id #uuid "3fbfac83-f221-5199-afc1-0a4537739b09" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-9375889e-3849-59d0-ae4d-d04ee45ddd27" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b25b3182-99f3-5733-be98-3b75b07c3ef6" "answer-3cf5e805-a9d8-501f-9421-02c871c68332" "answer-8bf7872a-2c29-5faa-80ca-39621ac3247c" "answer-9375889e-3849-59d0-ae4d-d04ee45ddd27" "answer-8026e352-ae01-5b9e-908e-f8cba6fafc4a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b25b3182-99f3-5733-be98-3b75b07c3ef6" :answer/id #uuid "b25b3182-99f3-5733-be98-3b75b07c3ef6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x={30}^{∘}+{30}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3cf5e805-a9d8-501f-9421-02c871c68332" :answer/id #uuid "3cf5e805-a9d8-501f-9421-02c871c68332" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x={30}^{∘}-{70}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8bf7872a-2c29-5faa-80ca-39621ac3247c" :answer/id #uuid "8bf7872a-2c29-5faa-80ca-39621ac3247c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x={70}^{∘}+{30}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9375889e-3849-59d0-ae4d-d04ee45ddd27" :answer/id #uuid "9375889e-3849-59d0-ae4d-d04ee45ddd27" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x={70}^{∘}-{30}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8026e352-ae01-5b9e-908e-f8cba6fafc4a" :answer/id #uuid "8026e352-ae01-5b9e-908e-f8cba6fafc4a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x={70}^{∘}\\times {30}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-461025dd-2d02-5f63-a292-225c3460091c" :question/id #uuid "461025dd-2d02-5f63-a292-225c3460091c" :question/math-academy-id "q-154877" :question/problem "![](images/e3/e3fe548e2dd695d682dec13287307e58fe28aa8a01b3e672695ef8ed07c61e1d.png)\n\nThe measure of the angle $∠BAE$ is ${150}^{∘}.$ Find the value of $x.$" :question/worked-solution "Here, the letter $x$ represents the measure of the unknown angle $∠DAE.$\n\nNote the following:\n\n- The angles $∠BAD$ and $∠DAE$ are adjacent because they share the side $\\overset{\\to }{AD}.$\n\n- So, the measure of the *large* angle $(∠BAE)$ must be the *sum* of the measures of the two *smaller* angles $(∠BAD$ and $∠DAE).$\n\n- This means that the measure of $∠DAE$ must be the *difference* between the large angle $(∠BAE)$ and the smaller known angle $(∠BAD).$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\nx={150}^{∘}-{110}^{∘}={40}^{∘}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-12052c87-241c-51ed-9c4a-9a79f264aed8"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-12052c87-241c-51ed-9c4a-9a79f264aed8" :answer-field/id #uuid "12052c87-241c-51ed-9c4a-9a79f264aed8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-29a6afa9-b529-5414-9a19-3b3fc81337f8" :answer-field/choices ["answer-3f7a872e-2d4d-56e9-8209-738dad1f2592" "answer-7f3e75ae-2804-5356-bb95-8cb89d465238" "answer-29a6afa9-b529-5414-9a19-3b3fc81337f8" "answer-4f714e49-22da-55c7-90a0-884a92cfbea8" "answer-3aecea04-7ddd-5554-8b9d-edb9d0abc379"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3f7a872e-2d4d-56e9-8209-738dad1f2592" :answer/id #uuid "3f7a872e-2d4d-56e9-8209-738dad1f2592" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{20}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7f3e75ae-2804-5356-bb95-8cb89d465238" :answer/id #uuid "7f3e75ae-2804-5356-bb95-8cb89d465238" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{35}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-29a6afa9-b529-5414-9a19-3b3fc81337f8" :answer/id #uuid "29a6afa9-b529-5414-9a19-3b3fc81337f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{40}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4f714e49-22da-55c7-90a0-884a92cfbea8" :answer/id #uuid "4f714e49-22da-55c7-90a0-884a92cfbea8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{45}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3aecea04-7ddd-5554-8b9d-edb9d0abc379" :answer/id #uuid "3aecea04-7ddd-5554-8b9d-edb9d0abc379" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{50}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-9a3a7198-9475-534b-8bac-8c66e26d7479" :question/id #uuid "9a3a7198-9475-534b-8bac-8c66e26d7479" :question/math-academy-id "q-4320" :question/problem "![](images/1e/1ed3b825702e9d446754d5bf56ff2964f8456bce45ab57fe9f6931458c9f5038.png)\n\nIn the figure above, $m∠DEA={147}^{∘}.$ Find the value of $x.$" :question/worked-solution "Here, the letter $x$ represents the measure of the unknown angle $∠CED.$\n\nThe measure of $∠CED$ must be the *difference* between the large angle $(∠DEA)$ and the two smaller known angles $(∠CEB$ and $∠BEA).$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\nx={147}^{∘}-{56}^{∘}-{40}^{∘}={51}^{∘}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-d9f495e7-479d-548e-a8f4-c607f00c6814"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-d9f495e7-479d-548e-a8f4-c607f00c6814" :answer-field/id #uuid "d9f495e7-479d-548e-a8f4-c607f00c6814" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-6db083d5-370f-54da-a961-6c7391ab4bea" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6db083d5-370f-54da-a961-6c7391ab4bea" "answer-14bf17c3-9309-5621-b172-5a68815fd9b2" "answer-bdd99ac5-f0db-569e-81a8-639572fbad02" "answer-65ed433c-44a1-5f6d-aac1-e740340944af" "answer-1899928f-124e-5f54-b642-61246e73c67e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6db083d5-370f-54da-a961-6c7391ab4bea" :answer/id #uuid "6db083d5-370f-54da-a961-6c7391ab4bea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{51}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-14bf17c3-9309-5